          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Tokyo Xanadu is an action RPG that blends dungeon crawling with high school life simulation. By day, you're a student in modern Tokyo building relationships and enjoying school activities. By night, you're pulled into Eclipse, a nightmarish alternate realm where you battle creatures born from human negative emotions. Master fast-paced real-time combat with elemental strategies and character switching, then return to strengthen bonds with classmates who fight alongside you with unique abilities.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
